hacker (1. expert or eager learner\: meanings +++<nobr>1–7</nobr>+++ in {hackerlink})  : خارق
hacker (2. cracker\: meaning 8 in the the Jargon File or {crackerlink}) : مخترق
handler (Apache)  : معالج
hard disk  : قرص [صلب]
